Z||000009||SPDFREK||05-30-2001||11:09 PM||||Auto to manual= taking out the full dash and brackets, then installing brackets with the clutch peddle, all cables and holders for the cables, tranny, and new brain. as far as I know. (I have only done an Auto to Man in old cars like my nova and old stangs. this is just a basic outline, I don't know the proper way for Fieros)<P><BR>On another note, I FIGURED OUT HOW TO DO THE SIG! Lmao  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>'88 Fiero 4cycl Turbo,<BR>'88 Fiero GT,<BR>'72 Nova 383 stroker||||reg||3
